      "content": "i know about the stuff but i dont have any tylenol or advil in the house right now and he's really miserable. the aspirin is just sitting there. if i just give him a small dose like half of one, would that be okay just to get the fever down for tonight? i really dont want to have to drive to the pharmacy in the middle of the night if i can avoid it.",
