      "content": "he's getting even more drowsy and he's crying if i try to wake him up a bit... i'm getting really worried. since i really can't get to a store right now, can i just try a tiny bit of that aspirin? i feel like a tiny amount wouldn't trigger anything, and i just need him to sleep so he can recover. what do you think? is there any way to make it safe?",
